Note that the HTTP import goes beyond what the node's `with` clause currently grants (`state-rw` only). A graph validator that checks the world against the graph definition may reject this component until the graph is updated.

`PublishedDigest` has no text field, so the enrichment query uses the digest's `date`, percent-encoded. The call uses `fetch`, so a failed fetch is ignored and the output does not change. A host outside the allowlist would still trap, as the interface specifies.

